  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "En 1012.06 Group Study Election. The applicant shall notify the utility of its election to participate in the group study within 10 business days of completion of the scoping meeting.\n\nSource. #14657, eff 9-1-26, EXPIRES: 9-1-36",
